r the military took power on November 26, 2025. The junta said the conditions were insufficient to hold presidential elections for now.</summary><category term="News" /></entry><entry><title>Africa's opposition voices face growing pressure</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:a38d561c7e01d65a75b716a28c86cd17504d0ee4e64e0dd3892b653f24c3c911</id><updated>2026-11-28T08:06:23Z</updated><published>2026-11-26T15:04:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/africa-s-opposition-voices-face-growing-pressure/a-80063893--fc3fb0c33bdb.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/africa-s-opposition-voices-face-growing-pressure/a-80063893?maca=en-rss-en-africa-8291-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">Opposition politicians and government critics say arrests, prosecutions and restrictions on public activity are making it harder to challenge those in power. Is a broader pattern emerging?</summary><category term="World" /></entry><entry><title>Russia-Ukraine war extends to Baltic, Mediterranean</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:01b6c9796b5fc912dca17e7f60d88fac4c8963b829621bffc96f3612625278d2</id><updated>2026-11-28T08:07:32Z</updated><published>2026-11-26T09:27:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/russia-ukraine-war-extends-to-baltic-mediterranean/a-80054604--b6459954c1cd.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/russia-ukraine-war-extends-to-baltic-mediterranean/a-80054604?maca=en-rss-en-africa-8291-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">By attacking Russian vessels around the world, Ukraine is trying to increase the pressure on Russia and also sending out signals to its Western allies. What is the impact on global maritime trade?</summary><category term="World" /></entry></feed>
